{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 ReaPack Repository\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This is an assortment of my random reaper scripts.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ADFXSound/ADFX/master/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Install layout\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaScripts install under {\f1 REAPER/Scripts/ADFXSound}. Shared recorder modules are under {\f1 REAPER/Scripts/ADFXSound/Modules}. JSFX install under {\f1 REAPER/Effects/ADFX}.\par}
}
